    366  02cb							; Demo motion (until there is gameplay): enemies walk left one pixel every
    367  02cb							; fourth frame and come back on the right; shots fly right one row (six
    368  02cb							; pixels) every fourth frame and restart at the first column. The TV type
    369  02cb							; switch on B/W holds everything still.
