    514  03ae							; choose: walk the sorted list from position frame mod n, wrapping, and
    515  03ae							; take each enemy whose rows (top-2 .. feet) miss every enemy taken so far.
    516  03ae							; The start moves every frame, so enemies that overlap take turns.
    517  03ae		       a2 00		      ldx	#0
